{"t": 1794116418.2124314, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline fix (main is red)\n\nMain pipeline #8812 fails in `test:contract` on `contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format`:\n\n```\nassert invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"\nE  AssertionError: assert 'INV-2026-42' == 'INV-2026-000042'\n```\n\nRoot cause: `billing/invoice.py` formatted the sequence with plain `{seq}`, so the sequence part was not zero-padded. ERP v2 (FIN-77) requires the sequence to be 6 digits wide.\n\nFix: `billing/invoice.py` now uses `f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"`. Verified locally: `invoice_number(2026, 42)` -> `INV-2026-000042`. `lint` was already green; no other files changed.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
